    fix(node-create): accept and forward --ref so README step 3 is reachable (CF-153)
    
    scripts/node-create.sh rejected the remedy its own node-side checker prints.
    scripts/project-node.sh supports --ref (REF="${NODE_REF:-main}", clones with
    `git clone --depth 1 --branch "$REF"`) and README Quick start step 3 documents
    scripts/node-create.sh as the create path, but node-create.sh parsed only
    --project/--repo/--harness/--agent/--ttl/--port/--staged-files and forwarded
    only NODE_PROJECT and NODE_GATEWAY_PORT into the node's `bash -lc` payload, so
    the ref could not cross. README already told the reader that a repo whose
    default branch is not main needs --ref <branch>.
    
    Pre-fix red measured at 20f93ad:
      $ bash scripts/node-create.sh --staged-files --ref master
      unknown arg: --ref                      rc=2
      $ BUNKER_SERVER=no-such-server bash scripts/node-create.sh --project p \
          --repo https://github.com/git/git --harness hermes --ref master
      unknown arg: --ref                      rc=2
    
    Changed:
    - scripts/node-create.sh: REF="${NODE_REF:-main}" default beside PROJECT/REPO/
      HARNESS; `--ref) REF="$2"; shift 2 ;;` in the argument loop (the *) arm still
      exits 2 on genuinely unknown flags); usage string and header comment carry
      [--ref <branch-or-tag>]. The ref crosses into the node's shell as
      --ref '<escaped>' with the same single-quote escaping already applied to
      CRIER_URL (REF_QUOTED); no new unescaped interpolation is introduced.
    - README.md: Quick start step 3 names --ref, and the paragraph that explains the
      main default now points at step 3 instead of describing a flag no shipped
      command accepted.
    - tests/selftest.sh: new section 35 asserts --staged-files --ref master exits 0
      with the unchanged five-file staged set (pre-fix: rc=2, unknown arg), and that
      a stub transport receives `--ref 'master'` and a ref containing a quote
      intact, asserted on the recorded bytes only.
    - docs/ACCEPTANCE-PLAN.md: Current state re-measured 2026-11-04T07:25Z at tip
      20f93ad — 35 sections, 37 arms, SELFTEST: PASS with 109 PASS / 19 FAIL rows,
      144 task rows and 264 events at that tip.
    
